      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roaring_Springs%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s brick depot, built in 1913, handled passengers and freight until 1971 before the town bought it the following year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roaring_Springs%2C_Texas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A historic hotel, also built in 1913, has recently been restored and now operates as a bed‑and‑breakfast for travelers.",
